      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\left|\\frac{x}{2}-1\\right|&=\\frac12|x-2|\\\\\\frac12|x-2|&\\ge|x-2|\\\\|x-2|&\\le0\\end{align*}$$\n\nAn absolute value is non-negative, so $|x-2|=0$ and $x=2$.",
